WEBVTT

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:16.330
There she is.

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:21.580
I must say I was surprised to
get an invitation to see you again.

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:29.010
Jeanne.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.350
Vanitas.

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:39.060
Let's go on a date.

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:51.530
THE 
CASE
 STUDY 
OF 
VANITAS

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:59.290
<i>You're pondering the simple things,</i>
<i>pretty much: human emotions, and love?</i>

00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:03.670
<i>I hope one day you'll understand</i>

00:01:03.670 --> 00:01:08.260
<i>Too many wounds have left you</i>
<i>patched together, a miserable sight</i>

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:13.510
<i>That doesn't even know</i>
<i>the definition of "alive"</i>

00:01:13.510 --> 00:01:21.020
<i>No need to say,</i>
<i>"Just the two of us" or anything</i>

00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:29.610
<i>I've a feeling we can understand</i>
<i>each other, and that's fine for now</i>

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:38.580
<i>I love this world,</i>
<i>and the light only you give me</i>

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:43.460
<i>Makes the world I see</i>
<i>through these fractured eyes </i>

00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:48.130
<i>Look gleaming and bright</i>

00:01:48.130 --> 00:01:52.720
<i>There's no such thing as a sure thing</i>

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:57.470
<i>But you can see me, can't you?</i>

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:06.310
<i>When sky and void meet, look back</i>
<i>because the dreams will come later</i>

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:14.240
Bonjour, Monsieur Vanitas.

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:18.370
I have a card addressed to you.

00:02:18.370 --> 00:02:22.120
Amelia, what did the person
who delivered this look like?

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:23.410
Forgive me.

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:28.210
The hotel asked me to hand it to you.
I didn't see who delivered it.

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:31.630
Monsieur Noé?

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:34.930
He fell off <i>again</i>?

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:38.220
Huh? Vanitas?

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:42.560
Where are you off to?

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:44.390
It's a secret.

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:50.650
A date?

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:52.940
As in you and me?

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:55.030
What's gotten into you?

00:02:55.030 --> 00:03:00.620
When I think back to when we first met,
it was I who struck the first blow.

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:04.080
I couldn't have blamed you
if you had killed me for that,

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:07.040
but you did not.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:11.960
It was the same at the masquerade ball.
You helped me save Master Luca.

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:15.720
You also saved the curse-bearers,

00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:18.800
though the other vampires
heaped scorn upon you.

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:24.390
I should have truly despised
that power you held over me.

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:29.350
But before I knew it, all I could
think about was you, day or night.

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:32.020
I think this means...

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:37.570
I have fallen for you!

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:43.700
So please allow me to determine whether
this feeling can truly be called love!

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:45.540
Huh?

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:50.670
I-I knew it.

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:54.630
This really <i>is </i>the
right way to go about it.

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:58.550
What? You wish to know
how to make Vanitas hate you?

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:01.260
That's right. I cannot stand that man.

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:05.140
But the more I reject him,
the more happily he cozies up to me.

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:08.980
I cannot stand to have him toy
with me a moment longer.

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:13.520
Lady Dominique, surely you know
what to do in such a situation.

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:16.570
Please, will you not advise me?!

00:04:16.570 --> 00:04:19.030
I've no clue about that sort of thing.

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:25.080
But Jeanne is so adorable
when she's in a fix.

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:27.450
I'd like to help her somehow.

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:29.620
Come to think of it,

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:32.250
Noé told me something interesting.

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:38.760
Vanitas once said, "I have zero interest
in the sort of person who would love me."

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:44.470
That means you simply have to
pretend you have grown fond of him.

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:49.180
That should make him lose
interest in you and leave you be.

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:59.860
Today I shall love you, body and soul,
so that you may come to despise me!

00:05:01.910 --> 00:05:05.990
But for this to work,
he must not realize it's an act.

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:11.670
This was so sudden,
it came as a bit of a shock.

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:18.760
But how could I possibly refuse
an invitation from you?

00:05:18.760 --> 00:05:20.170
Plus...

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:25.510
I'm terribly intrigued by
your sudden change of heart.

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:28.100
I'm so happy, Vanitas.

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:30.020
Say your prayers, Vanitas.

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:35.940
Now it's my turn to have
<i>you </i>in the palm of my hand!

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:41.360
I must say, Jeanne,
that dress is quite nice.

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:42.530
Isn't it?!

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:46.660
Lady Dominique gave it to me
along with the accessories!

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:50.700
She picked it out especially for me!

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:53.710
No, Jeanne.

00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:58.460
I'm saying it's you that is lovely.

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:07.220
Come now, Jeanne, let's go.

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:10.640
What was that?

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:15.850
Did I just react as if
I really were in love?

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:18.940
Huh?!

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:21.570
The quack and the Hellfire Witch?!

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:27.820
What the devil?
How is this even happening?!

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:30.490
Dominique de Sade?!

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:31.910
Milady?

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:34.660
Oh, you're that dham.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:36.120
What are you doing?

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:38.750
Isn't it obvious? I'm following them.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:41.340
Seriously?

00:06:41.340 --> 00:06:43.050
Look out! Jeanne!

00:06:47.930 --> 00:06:50.760
Are you all right, Jeanne?

00:06:53.730 --> 00:06:55.980
Forgive me! I...

00:06:59.650 --> 00:07:03.780
It's fine as long as you're unharmed,
but do be careful.

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:10.240
What is going on?

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:15.710
I had my suspicions, but it seems
Jeanne is quite the pushover.

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:29.470
Why is this even happening?

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:35.430
You have quite a unique way of sleeping.

00:07:39.650 --> 00:07:41.520
Lord Ruthven?!

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:46.400
Bonjour, my lad.
Did you have a sweet dream?

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:55.250
Forgive the sudden intrusion.

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:56.290
It's fine.

00:07:56.290 --> 00:08:00.380
This venerable cafe dates back
to the end of the 17th century.

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:04.250
It's one of my favorite
places in the mortal world.

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:08.760
Why are we the only ones in
your favorite "venerable" cafe?

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:12.180
I had them reserve the whole place for me.

00:08:12.180 --> 00:08:16.730
I wanted to have a
leisurely chat with you.

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:20.900
With me? Not Vanitas?

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:25.440
Of course, there are countless
questions I would ask that human.

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:29.860
However, he would speak
nothing of himself, would he?

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:33.620
Just like last time.

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:36.750
He got what he wanted out of me

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:40.370
but wouldn't allow me
even a moment to ask a question.

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:46.340
I don't know anything
about Vanitas's past, either.

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:50.510
Still, you must know
what sort of person he is.

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:55.890
And you are a child of the Shapeless One.

00:08:55.890 --> 00:09:01.560
That alone is reason enough
to take an interest in you.

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:05.440
Is my teacher that incredible a vampire?

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:09.950
Oh, my.

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:14.410
To think there was a vampire who
could treat one such as he so casually.

00:09:14.410 --> 00:09:18.750
Truth be told,
I really don't know, either.

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:29.970
I don't understand.

00:09:29.970 --> 00:09:35.720
I know I utterly loathed that man.

00:09:36.890 --> 00:09:42.480
But now my heart is racing like wild.

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:49.110
It's my duty to watch over this date,
seeing how I instigated it.

00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:52.490
I'm going to stick to those two like glue.

00:09:52.490 --> 00:09:53.700
That's dumb.

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:56.120
You shut up!

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:03.580
Vanitas. Please let go of my hand.

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:05.460
But you don't watch your step.

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:08.630
My parasol! I want to open it!

00:10:11.260 --> 00:10:14.180
What is going on? I don't get it!

00:10:14.180 --> 00:10:18.310
He was always selfish and egotistical.
Where did <i>that </i>man go?

00:10:18.310 --> 00:10:22.020
This is... This is...

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:25.230
...driving me mad.

00:10:25.230 --> 00:10:29.520
So, is there somewhere
special you'd like to go?

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:34.490
Since we're here, I'd like to see Paris.

00:10:34.490 --> 00:10:37.740
It's not like it's your first time here.

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:40.990
That's true, but...

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:45.420
When I'm with Master Luca,
I must keep a constant watch around him.

00:10:45.420 --> 00:10:49.790
I'm not allowed to enjoy the view.

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:54.170
Well then, today you must enjoy
the city to your heart's content.

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:24.830
What's that?!

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:27.170
The Palais Garnier, an opera house.

00:11:27.170 --> 00:11:28.040
And that?!

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:29.250
The Grands Magasins.

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:30.170
And that?!

00:11:30.170 --> 00:11:31.800
The Arc de Triomphe.

00:11:31.800 --> 00:11:32.630
And that?!

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:35.590
Calm down. They're merely cats.

00:11:37.470 --> 00:11:39.890
The whale swims again today.

00:11:39.890 --> 00:11:41.140
This is incredible!

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:45.270
The Paris in Altus
seems completely different!

00:11:52.570 --> 00:11:54.940
I shouldn't be enjoying this!

00:11:56.740 --> 00:11:59.410
Don't forget why
you're doing this, Jeanne!

00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:03.950
This date was meant to
sever all ties with Vanitas!

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:07.370
Jeanne, would you care for a crepe?

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:09.000
Yes, please!

00:12:11.840 --> 00:12:13.210
Boring...

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:18.170
Excuse me. This has turned into a
plain old date, so I'm gonna get going.

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:22.180
Don't be stupid.
You've come this far. Stick it out!

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:33.480
A fine view, don't you think?
Montmartre is the highest hill in Paris.

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:35.230
That tower...

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:41.200
It's the Sun Tower, the prime exhibit
at the next Exposition Universelle.

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:43.240
A truly tasteless structure.

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:49.500
I was convinced they would adopt
Gustave Eiffel's proposal, but...

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:52.630
It's just like the Tower of Babel.

00:12:57.340 --> 00:13:01.090
Now then, wait here a moment, Jeanne.

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:02.930
Where are you going?

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:05.100
The lavatory.

00:13:05.100 --> 00:13:08.270
I would hear your answer upon my return.

00:13:08.270 --> 00:13:10.690
Think upon it.

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:15.770
What is it?

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:17.820
I'm sorry. It's nothing.

00:13:17.820 --> 00:13:21.070
I don't mind. Just say it.

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:24.160
When I speak with you,

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:29.790
it's almost as if I'm with my teacher.

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:33.710
What could it be? The way you speak?

00:13:33.710 --> 00:13:37.210
I feel as if I'm attending class.

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:41.680
Or maybe it's just that I have
so much fun talking to you.

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:47.890
It's strange, isn't it? You seem
like completely different people.

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:55.560
Long ago, I did work
as a teacher of sorts.

00:13:55.560 --> 00:14:00.780
It was back when humans and vampires
still hated and slaughtered each other.

00:14:00.780 --> 00:14:05.530
Many students adored me
and gathered to my side.

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:09.910
I imparted them with knowledge
that would make them think.

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:14.000
I wanted them to join me
in creating a brighter future.

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:17.460
Are you still in touch with them?

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:20.380
They are dead.

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:23.090
They were all killed.

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:31.560
Forgive me for reminding you
of something so painful.

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:36.100
If I had students like you now,

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:39.360
my days would surely be filled with joy.

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:43.990
But I'm concerned.

00:14:43.990 --> 00:14:49.830
What if one who would take advantage
of your kindness were to appear?

00:14:49.830 --> 00:14:52.830
Do you speak of Vanitas?

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:56.500
He would never do so.

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:58.920
He'll try to use almost anyone,

00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:03.300
and yet he can't stand anyone
getting hurt because of him.

00:15:03.300 --> 00:15:06.300
He's a walking contradiction.

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:09.800
Vanitas believes humans
and vampires are the same.

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:14.430
He told me they're both
monstrous and selfish creatures.

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:18.400
I was annoyed when he said that,

00:15:18.400 --> 00:15:22.190
but I also sensed his loneliness.

00:15:23.820 --> 00:15:26.240
What do <i>you </i>think?

00:15:26.240 --> 00:15:31.410
What are vampires,
and what are humans to you?

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:39.790
What am I doing? I must focus.

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:42.380
This charade is almost over.

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:46.010
All I have to do is
convey my love for him.

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:49.180
I must practice what I'll say!

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:55.890
Vanitas, I had so much fun today.

00:15:55.890 --> 00:16:00.770
It was a joy to see
so many new sides of you.

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:06.900
It makes me want to learn
so much more about you.

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:11.280
It's just as I thought.

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:15.200
I'm starting to...

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:18.460
...take a fancy... to you.

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:23.550
Wait. Why do I feel so embarrassed?

00:16:23.550 --> 00:16:27.010
I said it like it was nothing before.

00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:31.140
I fancy you, too!

00:16:31.140 --> 00:16:32.550
Huh?! What?!

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:36.930
That just made my day, hearing you
profess your true feelings for me.

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:40.350
Wait! No! No! No!

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:41.900
Wrong reaction!

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:42.810
Is it?

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:47.650
You're supposed to look at me
with contempt, like I'm some maggot!

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:51.360
Now, now, my little bunny rabbit.
Whatever do you speak of?

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:53.830
Or is that a fetish of yours?

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:58.330
She's totally at his mercy.

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:01.000
Are you all right?

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:13.640
Jeanne?

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:18.020
Her eyes are red!

00:17:18.020 --> 00:17:19.810
V-Vampire!

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:22.270
She's a vampire!

00:17:25.570 --> 00:17:27.980
Calm yourself, Jeanne.

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:30.240
A smokescreen?

00:17:30.240 --> 00:17:32.450
Run, you quack!

00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:33.280
Oh, Dante!

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:35.580
You owe me one!

00:17:40.290 --> 00:17:46.340
What are vampires,
and what are humans to me?

00:17:46.340 --> 00:17:49.050
I don't understand what you're asking.

00:17:49.050 --> 00:17:54.890
It seems you were taken in and
raised by humans when you were young.

00:17:54.890 --> 00:17:57.510
Noé Archiviste.

00:17:57.510 --> 00:18:02.520
Are you on the side of the vampires?
Or are you our enemy?

00:18:07.610 --> 00:18:09.730
Neither one.

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:13.610
My enemies are anyone or
anything that would harm

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:17.450
those I hold dear or
whatever I wish to protect.

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:22.660
Simply being a vampire or a human
does not make someone my enemy.

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:28.210
I like vampires. I also like
humans in the same manner.

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:35.050
I see. Now I understand.

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:38.510
You failed the test.

00:18:39.850 --> 00:18:41.350
What's happening?

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:48.480
L-Lord Ruthven...

00:19:06.920 --> 00:19:09.540
Are you all right, Jeanne?

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:20.510
Jeanne, I asked you once before.

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:23.060
Are you a curse-bearer?

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:32.610
Have you seen Charlatan?

00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:37.320
Do you have any other symptoms
besides the urge to drink blood?

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:42.740
I am...

00:19:44.790 --> 00:19:50.340
Has someone forbidden you
to speak about this to others?

00:20:05.980 --> 00:20:10.440
Vanitas, I have...

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:15.110
I have kept my promise to you.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:19.780
I have not sucked the
blood of anyone but you.

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:35.550
Is that so? In that case...

00:20:35.550 --> 00:20:38.510
I must reward you.

00:20:49.690 --> 00:20:51.480
More.

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:53.770
Jeanne.

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:55.780
More!

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:02.280
<i>More</i>!

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:13.880
What shall I do?

00:21:13.880 --> 00:21:18.130
I feel my sanity slowly slipping away.

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:23.350
One day, I'll no longer be myself.

00:21:23.350 --> 00:21:28.680
What if the day comes
that I harm Master Luca?

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:37.900
Jeanne.

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:43.110
I still don't know whether
you're a curse-bearer.

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:46.080
As such, I can't promise
that I'll cure you.

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:49.080
But there's something I <i>can </i>do.

00:21:49.080 --> 00:21:52.120
I can promise you this.

00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:56.380
I will kill you if it ever comes to that.

00:21:59.010 --> 00:22:02.550
I promise that I will kill you.

00:22:09.510 --> 00:22:11.970
Promises

00:23:43.560 --> 00:23:46.980
Point of Departure
